Begin3
Title:          Assistance Demo
Version:        1.1
Entered-date:   2020-01-06
Description:    A simple package to demonstrate using a custom assistance program.
Summary:        A simple package to demonstrate using a custom assistance program that can be automatically incorporated by the FreeDOS build environment when creating custom install media. The package will autostart on USB and CD-ROM media. It will also be installed and used in both BASIC and FULL installation types.
Keywords:       freedos
Author:         Jerome Shidel <jerome _AT_ shidel.net>
